## Check result

`node test.mjs` → `PASS 01-clamp`

## Implementation

```js
export function clamp(value, lower, upper) {
  if (value < lower) return lower;
  if (value > upper) return upper;
  return value;
}
```

Matches TASK.md: bounds `value` to the inclusive `[lower, upper]` range, preserves in-range fractional values exactly, and when `lower === upper` both branches converge to that single value.

